POST http://localhost:8080/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "function factorial(n) { if (n <= 1) { return 1; } else { return n * factorial(n - 1); } } print(\"5! =\", factorial(5));"
}

### Tagalog factorial
POST http://localhost:8080/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lang": "tl",
  "code": "gawain factorial(n) { kung (n <= 1) { ibalik 1; } kundi { ibalik n * factorial(n - 1); } } ilimbag(\"5! =\", factorial(5));"
}
